#: quicktree.php
msgid "Save To New Tree"
msgstr "Bika mu Giti Gishya"

#: quicktree.php
msgid "Save To Branch"
msgstr "Bika mu Ishami"

#: quicktree.php
msgid "Clear All Graphs"
msgstr "Siba Ibishushanyo Byose"

#: quicktree.php
msgid "Graph Added to QuickTree"
msgstr "Igishushanyo Cyongewe muri QuickTree"

#: quicktree.php
#, php-format
msgid "Graph %s added to QuickTree.  Goto the QuickTree page to move all Graphs to a new or existing Tree."
msgstr "Igishushanyo %s cyongewe muri QuickTree.  Jya ku ipaji ya QuickTree kugira ngo wimurire Ibishushanyo byose mu Giti gishya cyangwa igisanzwe."

#: quicktree.php
msgid "Graph Not Added to QuickTree"
msgstr "Igishushanyo Ntikyongewe muri QuickTree"

#: quicktree.php
#, php-format
msgid "Graph %s was NOT added to QuickTree as it's already there waiting to be placed on a Tree.  Goto the QuickTree page to move all Graphs to a new or existing Tree."
msgstr "Igishushanyo %s NTIKYONGEWE muri QuickTree kuko gisanzwe kihari gitegereje gushyirwa ku Giti.  Jya ku ipaji ya QuickTree kugira ngo wimurire Ibishushanyo byose mu Giti gishya cyangwa igisanzwe."

#: quicktree.php
msgid "Graph Not Specified.  Not added to QuickTree"
msgstr "Igishushanyo Ntikagaragajwe.  Ntikyongewe muri QuickTree"

#: quicktree.php
msgid "No Graph was added to QuickTree as no Graph was specified."
msgstr "Nta Gishushanyo cyongewe muri QuickTree kuko nta Gishushanyo cyagaragajwe."

#: quicktree.php
msgid "Click 'Continue' to Add the following Tree."
msgstr "Kanda 'Komeza' kugira ngo wongereho Igiti gikurikira."

#: quicktree.php
msgid "Tree Name"
msgstr "Izina ry'Igiti"

#: quicktree.php
msgid "New Tree"
msgstr "Igiti Gishya"

#: quicktree.php
msgid "Branch Name"
msgstr "Izina ry'Ishami"

#: quicktree.php setup.php
msgid "QuickTree"
msgstr "QuickTree"

#: quicktree.php
msgid "Add To Branch"
msgstr "Ongeraho ku Ishami"

#: quicktree.php
msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "Hagarika"

#: quicktree.php
msgid "Continue"
msgstr "Komeza"

#: quicktree.php
msgid "Click 'Continue' to Add the following Tree Branch."
msgstr "Kanda 'Komeza' kugira ngo wongereho Ishami ry'Igiti rikurikira."

#: quicktree.php
msgid "Add to which Graph Tree?"
msgstr "Ongeraho ku kihe Giti cy'Ibishushanyo?"

#: quicktree.php
msgid "QuickTree has Created Tree and/or Branch and added Graphs"
msgstr "QuickTree yahanze Igiti na/cyangwa Ishami kandi yongeramo Ibishushanyo"

#: quicktree.php
msgid "QuickTree has no Graphs Queued"
msgstr "QuickTree nta Bishushanyo ifite ku murongo"

#: quicktree.php
msgid "Information/Directions"
msgstr "Amakuru/Amabwiriza"

#: quicktree.php
msgid "The Graphs below are Queue to be added to a Cacti Tree.  You may keep them here for as long as you like, or you can perform one of the following actions"
msgstr "Ibishushanyo biri hasi aha biri ku murongo bitegereje kongerwa mu Giti cya Cacti.  Ushobora kubigumisha hano igihe cyose ushaka, cyangwa ugakora kimwe mu bikorwa bikurikira"

#: quicktree.php
msgid "Save your selection to a new Graph Tree so you can keep them for later and work on something new."
msgstr "Bika ibyo wahisemo mu Giti cy'Ibishushanyo gishya kugira ngo ubibike uzabikoreshe nyuma kandi ukore ku bindi bishya."

#: quicktree.php
msgid "Save your selection as a branch to an existing tree so that they appear in a specific section of an existing tree."
msgstr "Bika ibyo wahisemo nk'ishami ku giti gisanzwe kugira ngo bigaragare mu gice cyihariye cy'igiti gisanzwe."

#: quicktree.php
msgid "Clear all graphs"
msgstr "Siba ibishushanyo byose"

#: quicktree.php
msgid "Clear the Graphs on this page from the Graphs Queue so that you have a blank QuickTree ready for new selections"
msgstr "Siba Ibishushanyo biri kuri iyi paji ubikure ku murongo w'Ibishushanyo kugira ngo ugire QuickTree yera yiteguye ibindi bishya uzahitamo"

#: quicktree.php
msgid "You can manage the individual graphs that appear here by clicking:"
msgstr "Ushobora gucunga buri gishushanyo kigaragara hano ukanze:"

#: quicktree.php
msgid "Add"
msgstr "Ongeraho"

#: quicktree.php
msgid "Graph View Page"
msgstr "Ipaji y'Imigaragarire y'Ibishushanyo"

#: quicktree.php
#, php-format
msgid "This icon is next to a Graph on the %s tab."
msgstr "Aka gashushanyo kari iruhande rw'Igishushanyo ku gafishi ka %s."

#: quicktree.php
msgid "Delete"
msgstr "Siba"

#: quicktree.php
msgid "This icon next to the Graphs below to remove them from the QuickTree Queue."
msgstr "Aka gashushanyo kari iruhande rw'Ibishushanyo biri hasi aha kugira ngo ubikure ku murongo wa QuickTree."

#: quicktree.php
msgid "Note:"
msgstr "Icyitonderwa:"

#: quicktree.php
msgid "Adding, removing or clearing on this page does not affect any other parts of Cacti (only Creating/Saving does)"
msgstr "Kongeraho, gukuramo cyangwa gusiba kuri iyi paji ntacyo bihindura ku bindi bice bya Cacti (guhanga/kubika gusa ni byo bibikora)"

#: quicktree.php
msgid "Actions"
msgstr "Ibikorwa"

#: quicktree.php
msgid "Remove This Graph From QuickTree"
msgstr "Kura Iki Gishushanyo muri QuickTree"

#: quicktree.php
msgid "No Graphs Added Yet"
msgstr "Nta Bishushanyo Birongerwamo"

